    {
      "subId": "7226104",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Kichiboushi",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "722610201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "722610201": {
            "id": "722610201",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That was a great shot!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610202"
            ]
          },
          "722610202": {
            "id": "722610202",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mmhaha! Kichiboushi, handsome!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610203"
            ]
          },
          "722610203": {
            "id": "722610203",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This kid's got zero humility...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610204"
            ]
          },
          "722610204": {
            "id": "722610204",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Ooh. Paimon, adepti use what magic?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610205"
            ]
          },
          "722610205": {
            "id": "722610205",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The adepti are super powerful. For example...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610206"
            ]
          },
          "722610206": {
            "id": "722610206",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's start with the amber around here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610207"
            ]
          },
          "722610207": {
            "id": "722610207",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "What is amber?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610208"
            ]
          },
          "722610208": {
            "id": "722610208",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Oh, Paimon remembers this one. Mountain Shaper has flowers that can create amber to trap bad things that invade his land inside them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610209"
            ]
          },
          "722610209": {
            "id": "722610209",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mon-Mon, very powerful. Defends Liyue by trapping bad things.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610210"
            ]
          },
          "722610210": {
            "id": "722610210",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Long ago, the very, very bad Four Oni of Ogata came into the forest and bullied many bake-danuki. Ioroi transformed into an official, gave them bake-danuki food to eat.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610211"
            ]
          },
          "722610211": {
            "id": "722610211",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Later, Ioroi and Otogi King threw them into paper and sealed them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610212"
            ]
          },
          "722610212": {
            "id": "722610212",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, so there's that sort of story too. No wonder Ioroi panicked when he saw that picture of Kichiboushi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610213"
            ]
          },
          "722610213": {
            "id": "722610213",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Ioroi is not adeptus, not defending Liyue. But Ioroi protects the forest. He protects tanuki.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610214"
            ]
          },
          "722610214": {
            "id": "722610214",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Different people have different things they need to defend.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610215"
            ]
          },
          "722610215": {
            "id": "722610215",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610216"
            ]
          },
          "722610216": {
            "id": "722610216",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "You'll figure it out once you're older, Kichiboushi.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610217"
            ]
          },
          "722610217": {
            "id": "722610217",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's why you've gotta train hard and become a super strong bake-danuki!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610218"
            ]
          },
          "722610218": {
            "id": "722610218",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mm! Of course! The world-famous bake-danuki, Kichiboushi!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610219"
            ]
          },
          "722610219": {
            "id": "722610219",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Paimon's really curious to know what Ioroi used to look like before he was sealed. He was probably a ball of fun!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610220"
            ]
          },
          "722610220": {
            "id": "722610220",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Huh, Paimon's suddenly reminded of those Treasure Hoarders who were trapped in amber...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610221"
            ]
          },
          "722610221": {
            "id": "722610221",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "They even took us for adepti messengers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610222"
            ]
          },
          "722610222": {
            "id": "722610222",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That feels like it was so long ago now. But at the same time, it wasn't, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610223"
            ]
          },
          "722610223": {
            "id": "722610223",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610224"
            ]
          },
          "722610224": {
            "id": "722610224",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ahem. Well, when we came to Liyue...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610225"
            ]
          },
          "722610225": {
            "id": "722610225",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#\"The Rite of Descension only happens once a year! Ahaha, I, {NICKNAME}, am gonna have all that delicious food! Come on, Paimon, let's go!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610226"
            ]
          },
          "722610226": {
            "id": "722610226",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "\"And all the offerings, too! Paimon's flying over there right now!\"",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610227"
            ]
          },
          "722610227": {
            "id": "722610227",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "??",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610228"
            ]
          },
          "722610228": {
            "id": "722610228",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Best we stop misrepresenting events...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610229"
            ]
          },
          "722610229": {
            "id": "722610229",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Okay, okay...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610230"
            ]
          },
          "722610230": {
            "id": "722610230",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You explain what happened in Liyue in simpler terms.\\nYou stop at the point where you went to seek the adepti out in Minlin.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610231"
            ]
          },
          "722610231": {
            "id": "722610231",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#...As for what happened next, {NICKNAME} and Paimon went to that Liuli Pavilion place we were at earlier.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610232"
            ]
          },
          "722610232": {
            "id": "722610232",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Mon-Mon and Clow-Clow, very powerful! They built a moving house!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610233"
            ]
          },
          "722610233": {
            "id": "722610233",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Clow-Cl— Cloud Retainer really loves gourmet food as well! We had to make lots of delicious stuff before we could meet with her.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610234"
            ]
          },
          "722610234": {
            "id": "722610234",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Greedy, like Paimon.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610237"
            ]
          },
          "722610237": {
            "id": "722610237",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hey!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610238"
            ]
          },
          "722610238": {
            "id": "722610238",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Is Paimon adeptus? Paimon is very powerful.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610239"
            ]
          },
          "722610239": {
            "id": "722610239",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uhh, this is kinda complicated. That was praise, sure, but Paimon doesn't feel so good about it...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610240"
            ]
          },
          "722610240": {
            "id": "722610240",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But either way, Paimon isn't an adeptus!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610241"
            ]
          },
          "722610241": {
            "id": "722610241",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Want to play with adepti!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610242"
            ]
          },
          "722610242": {
            "id": "722610242",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The adepti don't generally appear before people. But we can have a look around. It's pretty nice here.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "722610243"
            ]
          },
          "722610243": {
            "id": "722610243",
            "speakerId": 3160,
            "speakerName": "\"Kichiboushi\"",
            "text": "Kichiboushi, go!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7226105",
